  {
   "id": "pecaminosa-140807@1.0.1",
   "gameId": "pecaminosa-140807",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-06-01T11:25:56.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi detectives,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Our game’s launch was almost a week ago and it’s been a hell of a journey so far: a huge thanks from the middle of the Atlantic and an ocean-sized hug to all of you who have been supporting us.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Since launch, we’ve been keeping a watchful eye and taking notes regarding any feedback we’ve been receiving from our players, especially to reports of bugs and gameplay-related issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So below, you can see some of the contents of this new patch:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Balance Patches",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Removed the out of stamina walk speed penalty;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "John Souza’s walk speed has been increased;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where the game wouldn't detect the controller the first time you played the game;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where sometimes you could win or lose multiple times at once by repeatedly pressing the “Stand” button at blackjack;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where sometimes you would lose some perk points;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where you could get stuck on the third stage of Rourke if you dashed into the planks at the right time;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where Amuso’s zodiac puzzle would break if the player managed to activate 4 of the symbols fast enough;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where you couldn't take screenshots in the game with Steam Overlay;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where you could crash the game if you changed from mouse to controller and then went to the map;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where you could crash the game if you \"talked\" with the fridge in the right circumstances;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cereal Games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
